    "detailed_description": "<h1>Your Lover</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Lover</strong> is a desktop pet game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instructions for Use:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features face movement that follows the mouse, as well as support for dragging and zooming in/out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rotate the view using the right mouse button.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes an adorable desktop pet character.</p></li></ul>",
